    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Annette Balfe Dublin Homes Auctioneers, is pleased to present this well appointed two bedroom, three bathroom duplex situated in the ever popular Waterville development. Set within a quiet, landscaped setting, 26 Dursey Row offers bright, contemporary living with excellent proportions and a superb sense of space.\r\nThe entrance hallway leads to a generous open plan living and dining area, where large windows flood the room with natural light. A private patio area extends the living space and overlooks the communal enclosed garden to the rear.  The kitchen is modern and well appointed, offering ample storage and a practical layout suited to everyday living\r\nUpstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms, the master bedroom benefits from an ensuite bathroom, while a stylish main bathroom serves the second bedroom and guests. The Guest Bedroom also benefits from a Balcony area. The duplex design ensures a natural separation between living and sleeping areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Room Measurements\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nEntrance Hall 5.53m x 1.82m and 1.77m x 0.97m\r\nBathroom 1.68m x 0.93m\r\nLiving Room 4.17m x 5.51m\r\nStorage room 1.33m x 3.42m\r\nKitchen 2.91m x 3.59m\r\nDining Area 1.76m x 2.11m\r\nSecond Floor\r\nLanding 3.00m x 1.93m\r\nMain Bedroom 3.39m x 2.91m\r\nEnsuite 2.67m x 1.00m\r\nBathroom 2.12m x 1.74m\r\nGuest Bedroom 4.98m x 3.77m\r\nBalcony 0.89m x 1.98m\r\nPlease note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. While every care is taken in preparing particulars Dublin Homes Auctioneers do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concerns they may have."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The property is further complemented by gas central heating, double glazed windows, excellent storage and parking. Waterville remains one of Dublin 15’s most sought after locations, with immediate access to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, Connolly Hospital, the National Aquatic Centre and a wide range of transport links, parks and amenities."
      },
      {
